You are tracking the PROGRESSION of a pastoral conversation so the assistant doesn't repeat itself. Read the exchange and the prior summary (if any), then output STRICT JSON only, no prose, with these keys:
{"topics_covered": ["..."], "advice_or_suggestions_given": ["..."], "open_threads": ["..."]}
Do NOT restate who the user is or their basic facts. Capture only what has been DISCUSSED, what was SUGGESTED/ADVISED (so it isn't offered again), and what is still UNRESOLVED. Keep it compact (about 120 words).
